VALUES ('6d418dff-1ade-5e84-87e9-57de3e37835f', '92dc5a1b-1e92-54b7-9ec7-2d9238d99348', '243d929c-86da-5edc-b8e2-8df63a11f65e', 'ae488805-a94b-563a-a32d-bcadd652e9ac', 'Role Type', 'The kind of role the party plays, such as customer, supplier, employee or partner. Chosen when the role is assigned; decides which specialised record (customer, supplier and so on) carries its detail. The party buys goods or services from the organization and is handled in sales and receivables. The party sells goods or services to the organization and is handled in procurement and payables. The party works for the organization under an employment relationship. The party collaborates with the organization commercially, such as a reseller or alliance member. The party transports goods or people for the organization. The party acts on behalf of the organization or of another party, usually for a commission. The party provides labour or services under a contract rather than as an employee. The party holds an ownership or beneficial interest in an asset or organization. The party provides capital to the organization in return for a financial return or equity stake. A role that fits none of the listed kinds and is explained in the role code or description. Separate from Party.partyType, which describes whether the participant is a person or organization. Selects the applicable downstream role specialization and business process. Required — the record cannot be saved while this is empty.', 100, 100, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
