VALUES ('28fbcb90-d608-5204-95bf-2376cea232bb', '945a702e-2633-5a27-a8df-233bf1391c84', 'product_type', 'Product Type', 'What kind of offering the product is, which decides how it is bought, stocked and delivered. Chosen on creation; stock rules apply only to physical types. A finished physical item that is bought or sold and held in stock. A raw material or component consumed in production. Work performed for a customer, not held in stock. A recurring entitlement billed on a schedule. A durable item the business keeps and depreciates. A package of other products sold together. Anything else that is traded.', 1031, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 50, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
